 * <p>{@code seq} is a monotonically increasing sequence number across creates. {@code customerCode}
 * carries the owner's <em>current primary identifier</em> (see
 * {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.model.Owner#getPrimaryIdentifier()}): today the
 * customerCode, and whatever replaces it later — so when the customerCode is unified into the
 * memberId, this field automatically carries the memberId instead, with no change here.
 */
public record OwnerCreatedEvent(long seq, Integer ownerId, String customerCode, int membershipLevel,
                                String event) {

    /** The fixed {@code event} discriminator carried by every owner-created event. */
    public static final String EVENT_TYPE = "OWNER_CREATED";
}

